{"id":"B1-L028","title":"Verb pattern: ask someone to do — use","cefr":"B1","level":"B1","unit":"B1-U02","focus":"ask someone to do — uso","targets":{"grammar":"ask someone to do — uso","pron":"Sentence stress","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["trip reminder","packed lunch","phone rule","photo permission","trip fee","permission slip","safety rule","rain jacket","group photo","field trip","return time","trip leader","school bus ride","lunch box","trip checklist","sun cream","first aid kit","emergency contact"],"field":"Educação","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Escuta","words_min":18},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 28 · Verb pattern: ask someone to do — use","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** ask someone to do — uso.","**Pronúncia:** Sentence stress.","**18 palavras novas** (educação).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B1):** eu consigo usar ask / tell / allow / remind + objeto + to em e-mails e mensagens."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["trip reminder","lembrete do passeio"],["packed lunch","lanche levado"],["phone rule","regra do celular"],["photo permission","autorização de foto"],["trip fee","taxa do passeio"],["permission slip","autorização assinada"],["safety rule","regra de segurança"],["rain jacket","casaco de chuva"],["group photo","foto em grupo"],["field trip","excursão"],["return time","hora de retorno"],["trip leader","chefe do passeio"],["school bus ride","viagem de ônibus escolar"],["lunch box","lancheira"],["trip checklist","lista do passeio"],["sun cream","protetor solar"],["first aid kit","kit de primeiros socorros"],["emergency contact","contato de emergência"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"teacher@school.com","to":"parents@mail.com","subject":"Class trip reminder","paras":["Dear parents,","Please **remind your children to bring** a lunch. We **ask them not to carry** phones. The guide **will allow them to take** photos. Could you **tell your child to arrive** by 8:00?","Thank you, Mr. Silva"],"gloss":[["remind","lembrar"],["lunch","lanche"],["guide","guia"],["arrive","chegar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Parents should remind children to bring lunch.","ans":"T","why":"bring a lunch."},{"q":"Children can carry phones.","ans":"F","why":"not to carry."},{"q":"Children arrive by 8:00.","ans":"T","why":"by 8:00."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“remind” = ?","opts":["lembrar","remover","rever"],"ans":0,"why":"remind."},{"q":"“arrive” = ?","opts":["chegar","arriscar","arrumar"],"ans":0,"why":"arrive."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Polite requests in e-mails","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["Please remind… to","**Please remind them to bring lunch.**"],["ask… not to","**We ask them not to run.**"],["allow… to","**The guide allows us to take photos.**"],["Could you tell… to","**Could you tell her to call me?**"]],"cap":"Polite requests in e-mails"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"Em e-mails formais, **Could you…?** e **Please…** deixam o pedido educado."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"Please remind them ___ bring lunch. (to)","a":"to","why":"remind + obj + to."},{"s":"We ask them ___ to carry phones. (not)","a":"not","why":"not to."},{"s":"The guide ___ us take photos. (allow → allows)","a":"allows","why":"allow."},{"s":"Could you tell her ___ arrive early? (to)","a":"to","why":"tell + o